# Project Development Guide

## 1. Code Style and Formatting

### General Rules

- **Indentation**: Use 2 spaces
- **Semicolons**: Always use
- **Quotes**: Use single quotes (') (double quotes in JSX)
- **Line length**: Maximum 100 characters
- Follow **Prettier** and **ESLint** configurations

### File Structure (FSD Architecture)

Use Feature-Sliced Design architecture for hierarchical organization.
Structure varies depending on project type.

