#### Responsive Breakpoint Guide

- **sm**: 640px and above (tablet portrait)
- **md**: 768px and above (tablet landscape)
- **lg**: 1024px and above (laptop)
- **xl**: 1280px and above (desktop)
- **2xl**: 1536px and above (large monitor)

