### Animations and Transitions

Enhance user experience with light animations. Avoid excessive animations.

```typescript
// ✅ Good: Natural transitions
<button className="
  bg-blue-600
  text-white
  px-4 py-2
  rounded-md
  transition-all
  duration-200
  hover:bg-blue-700
  hover:scale-105
  active:scale-95
">
  Button
</button>

// ✅ Good: Fade-in animation
<div className="
  opacity-0
  animate-fade-in
  transition-opacity
  duration-300
">
  Content
</div>

// ✅ Good: Hover effects
<div className="
  group
  cursor-pointer
  transition-all
  duration-300
  hover:scale-105
  hover:shadow-lg
">
  <div className="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
    Overlay
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ Bad: Excessive animations
<div className="animate-bounce animate-spin animate-pulse">
  {/* Too many animations */}
</div>
```

#### Animation Guide

- **Transition Duration**: `duration-150` ~ `duration-300` (fast and natural feel)
- **Hover Effects**: `hover:scale-105`, `hover:shadow-lg` (subtle changes)
- **Focus Effects**: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500` (accessibility enhancement)
- **Loading State**: `animate-pulse` (when loading data)

