### Design Checklist

When writing components, check the following:

- [ ] Does it work responsively from mobile to desktop?
- [ ] Is readability good with appropriate color contrast?
- [ ] Are hover/focus states clearly displayed?
- [ ] Are animations natural and not excessive?
- [ ] Is there sufficient spacing and gaps?
- [ ] Are shadows and depth appropriate?
- [ ] Is text size hierarchically well-structured?
- [ ] Are buttons and interactive elements large enough and easy to click?

